{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Build. Burn. Freeze. Poison!</strong></u><br><br>Waves of furry critters are coming for you!<br><br>Deer<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/45e44c4bf2db782a2a8aeb41fda47693.poster.avif?t=1760043725\" width=580 height=84 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/45e44c4bf2db782a2a8aeb41fda47693.webm?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/45e44c4bf2db782a2a8aeb41fda47693.mp4?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Huskies<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/245c65cd46dfd0f6e5aff8b34510a712.poster.avif?t=1760043725\" width=580 height=84 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/245c65cd46dfd0f6e5aff8b34510a712.webm?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/245c65cd46dfd0f6e5aff8b34510a712.mp4?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Even tigers<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/6515104d69b34be535de48fa0b3e97a4.poster.avif?t=1760043725\" width=580 height=84 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/6515104d69b34be535de48fa0b3e97a4.webm?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/6515104d69b34be535de48fa0b3e97a4.mp4?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>It's your job to stop them! <strong>All year long!</strong><br>Sunshine, rain or snow: they don't stop, and neither should you!<br><br>Place towers, combine their effects, watch as fire, ice, poison and lightning clash in chaotic ways. But be careful: fire and ice cancel each other out - and enemies don't just take it lying down. Some are fast, some armored, some heal themselves - and all of them want through.<br><br>At the end of each level? Brutal <strong>challenge waves</strong> that give no gold and no mercy - just a chance to prove your build and climb the leaderboards.<br><br><u><strong>What's in the realm?</strong></u><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>14 unique towers</strong>: from the classic arrow shooters to furball launchers and even hypnotic beams that send enemies moonwalking backwards.<br></li><li><strong>Combos</strong>: burn them, freeze them, gas them - watch what happens when the effects combine.<br></li><li><strong>Seasonal battles</strong>: levels are themed by the months of the year, with weather effects that change the feel of the battlefield.<br></li><li><strong>Highscore chase</strong>: replay any level to beat your own score, or your friend's.<br></li><li><strong>Map editor</strong>: design your own, build your waves and share the madness.</li></ul><br><u><strong>The towers</strong></u><br><br><strong>Arrow Blunt</strong><br>Target an enemy and let it feel the... sharp sting?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/7aca6d99ef39b50ab123a04d4b3bf3f2.poster.avif?t=1760043725\" width=580 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/7aca6d99ef39b50ab123a04d4b3bf3f2.webm?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/7aca6d99ef39b50ab123a04d4b3bf3f2.mp4?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Arrow Fire</strong><br>Set it ablaze, dealing damage over time.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/007c9458c15160fcc510e74a5f515771.poster.avif?t=1760043725\" width=580 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/007c9458c15160fcc510e74a5f515771.webm?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/007c9458c15160fcc510e74a5f515771.mp4?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Arrow Ice</strong><br>Slow it to a crawl.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/ec9547b94c494b31ba2bfe3f553d651b.poster.avif?t=1760043725\" width=580 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/ec9547b94c494b31ba2bfe3f553d651b.webm?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/ec9547b94c494b31ba2bfe3f553d651b.mp4?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Arrow Poison</strong><br>For the undecided (<i>or is it?</i>), combining the effects of both fire and ice - but milder.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/b6845c747d42c4c0c57ba41a72b35db3.poster.avif?t=1760043725\" width=580 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/b6845c747d42c4c0c57ba41a72b35db3.webm?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/b6845c747d42c4c0c57ba41a72b35db3.mp4?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Cannon Blunt</strong><br>Send cannonballs flying through the air, with a splash effect on impact.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/03fea356fdc54e121762ba55b0758eca.poster.avif?t=1760043725\" width=580 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/03fea356fdc54e121762ba55b0758eca.webm?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/03fea356fdc54e121762ba55b0758eca.mp4?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Cannon Gas</strong><br>Fill the field with deadly clouds, damaging any enemy passing through.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/c2e3a6b901013ddc3c80e7d1d9593b13.poster.avif?t=1760043725\" width=580 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/c2e3a6b901013ddc3c80e7d1d9593b13.webm?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/c2e3a6b901013ddc3c80e7d1d9593b13.mp4?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Cannon Oil</strong><br>Sprinkle oil patches in their path, slowing every unit passing through.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/8042dc419755e4a66670800ab24da1d4.poster.avif?t=1760043725\" width=580 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/8042dc419755e4a66670800ab24da1d4.webm?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/8042dc419755e4a66670800ab24da1d4.mp4?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Cannon Furball</strong><br>Clamp the roads with furballs, damaging and slowing any critter unfortunate enough to stumble into them.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/54778ff9c5e87aa594e130fed02da87b.poster.avif?t=1760043725\" width=580 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/54778ff9c5e87aa594e130fed02da87b.webm?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/54778ff9c5e87aa594e130fed02da87b.mp4?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Sniper</strong><br>Those armored units sure don't like it, as it pierces through.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/93e5ca04a893f8bb390f4a1d78c50153.poster.avif?t=1760043725\" width=580 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/93e5ca04a893f8bb390f4a1d78c50153.webm?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/93e5ca04a893f8bb390f4a1d78c50153.mp4?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Shotgun</strong><br>Shoot scattered projectiles, damaging anything that comes close.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/13469121bbfc72a3bfcd33f91f228ad5.poster.avif?t=1760043725\" width=580 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/13469121bbfc72a3bfcd33f91f228ad5.webm?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/13469121bbfc72a3bfcd33f91f228ad5.mp4?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Laser</strong><br>Focus, focus!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/3d2958400b254a9fce382032dae286b3.poster.avif?t=1760043725\" width=580 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/3d2958400b254a9fce382032dae286b3.webm?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/3d2958400b254a9fce382032dae286b3.mp4?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Lightning</strong><br>Lightning bolts with chain bounces, don't wanna be too close to your critter buddy!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/6a690a2a6dab1d85536d3d5664b6ca20.poster.avif?t=1760043725\" width=580 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/6a690a2a6dab1d85536d3d5664b6ca20.webm?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/6a690a2a6dab1d85536d3d5664b6ca20.mp4?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Hypnotic</strong><br>Where are you going?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/81db350bb3493a308fe86c1667b6e671.poster.avif?t=1760043725\" width=580 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/81db350bb3493a308fe86c1667b6e671.webm?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/81db350bb3493a308fe86c1667b6e671.mp4?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Stasis</strong><br>Slows the blood flow, increasing damage.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/81ea9b49cdd2e1488e2aece727af837f.poster.avif?t=1760043725\" width=580 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/81ea9b49cdd2e1488e2aece727af837f.webm?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/81ea9b49cdd2e1488e2aece727af837f.mp4?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><u><strong>The effects</strong></u><br><br><strong>Explosions, Toxic and Snow Clouds</strong><br>When burning, poisoned or frozen units come in contact with gas clouds, they won't be celebrating.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/c52b32a29f7a2503282bd163ce7afc87.poster.avif?t=1760043725\" width=580 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/c52b32a29f7a2503282bd163ce7afc87.webm?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/c52b32a29f7a2503282bd163ce7afc87.mp4?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Burning and Acid Patches, Ice Slicks</strong><br>Burning, poisoned or frozen critters better watch their step - walking into oil patches won't be too much fun... for them.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/e6c036a810a3b17a6f5b1bbaef05130d.poster.avif?t=1760043725\" width=580 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/e6c036a810a3b17a6f5b1bbaef05130d.webm?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/e6c036a810a3b17a6f5b1bbaef05130d.mp4?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Burning, Venom and Razor Furballs</strong><br>If you're burning, poisoned or are frozen - avoid furballs at any cost... if you can.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/db6d7d48433bc971672666fe0acd7262.poster.avif?t=1760043725\" width=580 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/db6d7d48433bc971672666fe0acd7262.webm?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/db6d7d48433bc971672666fe0acd7262.mp4?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><u><strong>It's cute. It's chaotic. It's competitive.</strong></u><br><br>Tower placement is everything. Plan it right and watch them wipe the board. Do it wrong and... well, at least enjoy the furball mayhem!<br><br>Twelve months. Every day a new wave. Can you outlast the year?</p>","achievements":{"total":0},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4040290?t=1760043725","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4040290?t=1760043725","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/34ccc6512049eecf05c02ba1cda5dc15e110052b/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760043725","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/34ccc6512049eecf05c02ba1cda5dc15e110052b/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760043725","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Build. Burn. Freeze. Poison!</strong></u><br><br>Waves of furry critters are coming for you!<br><br>Deer<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/45e44c4bf2db782a2a8aeb41fda47693.poster.avif?t=1760043725\" width=580 height=84 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/45e44c4bf2db782a2a8aeb41fda47693.webm?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/45e44c4bf2db782a2a8aeb41fda47693.mp4?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Huskies<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/245c65cd46dfd0f6e5aff8b34510a712.poster.avif?t=1760043725\" width=580 height=84 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/245c65cd46dfd0f6e5aff8b34510a712.webm?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/245c65cd46dfd0f6e5aff8b34510a712.mp4?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>Even tigers<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/6515104d69b34be535de48fa0b3e97a4.poster.avif?t=1760043725\" width=580 height=84 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/6515104d69b34be535de48fa0b3e97a4.webm?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/6515104d69b34be535de48fa0b3e97a4.mp4?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>It's your job to stop them! <strong>All year long!</strong><br>Sunshine, rain or snow: they don't stop, and neither should you!<br><br>Place towers, combine their effects, watch as fire, ice, poison and lightning clash in chaotic ways. But be careful: fire and ice cancel each other out - and enemies don't just take it lying down. Some are fast, some armored, some heal themselves - and all of them want through.<br><br>At the end of each level? Brutal <strong>challenge waves</strong> that give no gold and no mercy - just a chance to prove your build and climb the leaderboards.<br><br><u><strong>What's in the realm?</strong></u><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>14 unique towers</strong>: from the classic arrow shooters to furball launchers and even hypnotic beams that send enemies moonwalking backwards.<br></li><li><strong>Combos</strong>: burn them, freeze them, gas them - watch what happens when the effects combine.<br></li><li><strong>Seasonal battles</strong>: levels are themed by the months of the year, with weather effects that change the feel of the battlefield.<br></li><li><strong>Highscore chase</strong>: replay any level to beat your own score, or your friend's.<br></li><li><strong>Map editor</strong>: design your own, build your waves and share the madness.</li></ul><br><u><strong>The towers</strong></u><br><br><strong>Arrow Blunt</strong><br>Target an enemy and let it feel the... sharp sting?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/7aca6d99ef39b50ab123a04d4b3bf3f2.poster.avif?t=1760043725\" width=580 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/7aca6d99ef39b50ab123a04d4b3bf3f2.webm?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/7aca6d99ef39b50ab123a04d4b3bf3f2.mp4?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Arrow Fire</strong><br>Set it ablaze, dealing damage over time.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/007c9458c15160fcc510e74a5f515771.poster.avif?t=1760043725\" width=580 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/007c9458c15160fcc510e74a5f515771.webm?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/007c9458c15160fcc510e74a5f515771.mp4?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Arrow Ice</strong><br>Slow it to a crawl.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/ec9547b94c494b31ba2bfe3f553d651b.poster.avif?t=1760043725\" width=580 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/ec9547b94c494b31ba2bfe3f553d651b.webm?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/ec9547b94c494b31ba2bfe3f553d651b.mp4?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Arrow Poison</strong><br>For the undecided (<i>or is it?</i>), combining the effects of both fire and ice - but milder.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/b6845c747d42c4c0c57ba41a72b35db3.poster.avif?t=1760043725\" width=580 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/b6845c747d42c4c0c57ba41a72b35db3.webm?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/b6845c747d42c4c0c57ba41a72b35db3.mp4?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Cannon Blunt</strong><br>Send cannonballs flying through the air, with a splash effect on impact.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/03fea356fdc54e121762ba55b0758eca.poster.avif?t=1760043725\" width=580 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/03fea356fdc54e121762ba55b0758eca.webm?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/03fea356fdc54e121762ba55b0758eca.mp4?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Cannon Gas</strong><br>Fill the field with deadly clouds, damaging any enemy passing through.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/c2e3a6b901013ddc3c80e7d1d9593b13.poster.avif?t=1760043725\" width=580 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/c2e3a6b901013ddc3c80e7d1d9593b13.webm?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/c2e3a6b901013ddc3c80e7d1d9593b13.mp4?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Cannon Oil</strong><br>Sprinkle oil patches in their path, slowing every unit passing through.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/8042dc419755e4a66670800ab24da1d4.poster.avif?t=1760043725\" width=580 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/8042dc419755e4a66670800ab24da1d4.webm?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/8042dc419755e4a66670800ab24da1d4.mp4?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Cannon Furball</strong><br>Clamp the roads with furballs, damaging and slowing any critter unfortunate enough to stumble into them.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/54778ff9c5e87aa594e130fed02da87b.poster.avif?t=1760043725\" width=580 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/54778ff9c5e87aa594e130fed02da87b.webm?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/54778ff9c5e87aa594e130fed02da87b.mp4?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Sniper</strong><br>Those armored units sure don't like it, as it pierces through.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/93e5ca04a893f8bb390f4a1d78c50153.poster.avif?t=1760043725\" width=580 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/93e5ca04a893f8bb390f4a1d78c50153.webm?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/93e5ca04a893f8bb390f4a1d78c50153.mp4?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Shotgun</strong><br>Shoot scattered projectiles, damaging anything that comes close.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/13469121bbfc72a3bfcd33f91f228ad5.poster.avif?t=1760043725\" width=580 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/13469121bbfc72a3bfcd33f91f228ad5.webm?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/13469121bbfc72a3bfcd33f91f228ad5.mp4?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Laser</strong><br>Focus, focus!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/3d2958400b254a9fce382032dae286b3.poster.avif?t=1760043725\" width=580 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/3d2958400b254a9fce382032dae286b3.webm?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/3d2958400b254a9fce382032dae286b3.mp4?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Lightning</strong><br>Lightning bolts with chain bounces, don't wanna be too close to your critter buddy!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/6a690a2a6dab1d85536d3d5664b6ca20.poster.avif?t=1760043725\" width=580 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/6a690a2a6dab1d85536d3d5664b6ca20.webm?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/6a690a2a6dab1d85536d3d5664b6ca20.mp4?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Hypnotic</strong><br>Where are you going?<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/81db350bb3493a308fe86c1667b6e671.poster.avif?t=1760043725\" width=580 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/81db350bb3493a308fe86c1667b6e671.webm?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/81db350bb3493a308fe86c1667b6e671.mp4?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Stasis</strong><br>Slows the blood flow, increasing damage.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/81ea9b49cdd2e1488e2aece727af837f.poster.avif?t=1760043725\" width=580 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/81ea9b49cdd2e1488e2aece727af837f.webm?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/81ea9b49cdd2e1488e2aece727af837f.mp4?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><u><strong>The effects</strong></u><br><br><strong>Explosions, Toxic and Snow Clouds</strong><br>When burning, poisoned or frozen units come in contact with gas clouds, they won't be celebrating.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/c52b32a29f7a2503282bd163ce7afc87.poster.avif?t=1760043725\" width=580 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/c52b32a29f7a2503282bd163ce7afc87.webm?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/c52b32a29f7a2503282bd163ce7afc87.mp4?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Burning and Acid Patches, Ice Slicks</strong><br>Burning, poisoned or frozen critters better watch their step - walking into oil patches won't be too much fun... for them.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/e6c036a810a3b17a6f5b1bbaef05130d.poster.avif?t=1760043725\" width=580 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/e6c036a810a3b17a6f5b1bbaef05130d.webm?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/e6c036a810a3b17a6f5b1bbaef05130d.mp4?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><strong>Burning, Venom and Razor Furballs</strong><br>If you're burning, poisoned or are frozen - avoid furballs at any cost... if you can.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/db6d7d48433bc971672666fe0acd7262.poster.avif?t=1760043725\" width=580 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/db6d7d48433bc971672666fe0acd7262.webm?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/extras/db6d7d48433bc971672666fe0acd7262.mp4?t=1760043725\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><u><strong>It's cute. It's chaotic. It's competitive.</strong></u><br><br>Tower placement is everything. Plan it right and watch them wipe the board. Do it wrong and... well, at least enjoy the furball mayhem!<br><br>Twelve months. Every day a new wave. Can you outlast the year?</p>","developers":["Tigerish Games"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3798190","name":"Fluffy Tower Defense"},"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4040290/64652f6880ca245239fedcc739fb1a0de06c7b00/header.jpg?t=1760043725","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Fluffy Tower Defense Demo","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Tigerish Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":false,"date":"9 Oct, 2025"},"required_age":0,"short_description":"Build towers, unleash fire, ice, poison and lightning upon waves of furry critters that run throughout all four seasons. Crazy combos, chain reactions and endless mayhem: can you survive the year?","steam_appid":4040290,"support_info":{"email":"ShereKhanSK-Developer@yahoo.com","url":"http://www.tigerishgames.com/"},"supported_languages":"English","type":"demo","website":"http://www.tigerishgames.com/"}